      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§e§lUNLOCK§r The T5 milestones, then:\n- put the §bMagnetar Seed Core§r in escrow;\n- build the §bgalactic rim§r (stack 6: 7,286 Galactic Shell Plating);\n- bring compression to 6, with §bno star lit§r;\n- put §bStar Chart: SGR 1806-20§r in the slot;\n- buffer §b18,432 L WDM + 4,608 L BDM + 100,000 L Agent§r.\n\n§e§lMAGNETAR MERGER§r White and black dwarf matter combine into a magnetar. The dynamo winds the polarity §bΠ§r up by itself.\n1. Hold Π inside §b+60..+90 for 120 s§r to imprint the field. You have 600 s.\n2. Then bring Π back inside §b±40 within 60 s§r.\nA failure loses the charge; the core is kept.\n\n§e§lRUN§r §b3,000 L Antipolarization Agent§r a cycle is its constant feed, and the same Agent charges the §bflare shield A§r. It makes §b15 L Magnetar Matter§r a cycle.\n- Π runs away by itself.\n- §bGiant flares§r come every 60-120 s, announced §b15 s ahead with their sign§r.\n- Pre-charge the shield on the warning (100 L of Agent = A +4, at most 5 a second).\nLose the magnetar and a re-merge needs the charge again, but not the core.\n\n[note]Magnetar Matter is Eye T7's upkeep and the base of the T9 pellets (planned).[/note]\n\n§a§lDONE WHEN§r you hold the core and the chart (HOLD → CLAIM → INSTALL: claim before the core goes into escrow).",
